      "origin": "new_teaching_material",
      "status": "candidate_pending_grammar_and_source_reconciliation",
      "candidate_text": "Twēgen męnn bǣron męte. Hiera gefēran sǣton on ðǣm hofe. Ðā męnn gēafon ðǣm gefērum ðone męte, and hīe ǣton. Ān mann ne ǣt. Hē geaf his męte ðǣm fuglum. Ðā fuglas ǣton and flugon. Se mann sæt on ðǣm strande and geseah ðā fiscas. Ðā fiscas swummon on ðǣm wætere.",
